# MP-11 - Cart data loss on session expiration / browser close

## Priority
Medium

## Type
Edge

## Steps

1. Login with valid credentials.
2. Add one or more products to cart.
3. Simulate session expiration by clearing cookies/localStorage/session storage for the site or closing and reopening the browser (use a new browser session).
4. Reopen SauceDemo and log in again.
5. Open the cart page.

## Expected Result

If the application uses session storage, cart may be cleared after session expiration — verify and document behavior. If the app promises persistence across sessions, items should still appear. In all cases, the behavior should be deterministic and not cause data corruption or errors; if cart is lost, application should not crash and should allow normal shopping flow.
